<title>SWEDEN: Den Danske says Ostgota bid near complete.</title>
<headline>Den Danske says Ostgota bid near complete.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den Danske Banksaid on Friday it has 96.9 percent of capital and votes in Sweden's Ostgota Bank. Den Danske said the offer for remaining shares would close on May 30.</p>
</text>
